== Better Sorting -- Status Update

#info[
  Better Sorting remains unavailable for B42. The situation is unchanged since Wave 0:

  - Original Better Sorting (2313387159): B41 only, last updated 2023.
  - [ABANDONED][B42] fork (3413005308): Marked abandoned by its author.
  - Compatibility patch (3624020087): Support suspended by author as of January 2026. Depends on the abandoned fork.
  - A new sorting mod is in development but not yet released.

  For inventory organization, Wave 1 uses #link("https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3767639280")[Item Arrange] as a lightweight alternative. A full B42-native sorting solution will be revisited in Wave 2 if one emerges.
]

